      "source": "This configuration backs-off completely if there is a bean of type\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/core/userdetails/ReactiveUserDetailsService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.core.userdetails\"><code>ReactiveUserDetailsService</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/authentication/ReactiveAuthenticationManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.authentication\"><code>ReactiveAuthenticationManager</code></a>, or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/authentication/ReactiveAuthenticationManagerResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.authentication\"><code>ReactiveAuthenticationManagerResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此配置在存在类型为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/core/userdetails/ReactiveUserDetailsService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.core.userdetails\"><code>ReactiveUserDetailsService</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/authentication/ReactiveAuthenticationManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.authentication\"><code>ReactiveAuthenticationManager</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/authentication/ReactiveAuthenticationManagerResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.authentication\"><code>ReactiveAuthenticationManagerResolver</code></a> 的 Bean 时，会完全退避。",
